    "id": "tender_527722/1611289",
    "title": "PS26173 - Unlocking Space for Business Delivery Partner",
    "description": "***** THIS IS AN AWARD NOTICE, NOT A CALL FOR COMPETITION *****\r\n\r\n\r\nThis procurement is being concluded following a mini competition under the  RM6235 Space-Enabled and Geospatial Services\r\n\r\nBrief Description of Requirement\r\n\r\nThe Unlocking Space for Business Programme is seeking a capable and experienced delivery partner (or consortium) to design and deliver end-user business engagement activities, to enable successful delivery of the programme through to March 2028. We expect the delivery partner to support on: \r\n\r\nDelivery of targeted Discovery Events and workshops  \r\n\r\nTargeted end-user thematic engagement through the delivery partner's existing networks (e.g. life sciences and pharmaceuticals, environmental monitoring, agriculture and food supply chain) \r\n\r\nChallenge-statement development and associated event delivery (e.g. Hackathons, challenge-led events) \r\n\r\nUpdate external publications (building on existing USB publications including The Space Advantage Report)",
